782	/****************************************************************************
783	 * Name: lcd_spi_write
784	 *
785	 * Description:
786	 *   Write data bytes via hardware SPI1 with timeout-protected polling.
787	 *   Returns 0 on success, -ETIMEDOUT if FIFO stalls.
788	 *   If sent_out is non-NULL, *sent_out receives the number of bytes
